Piastrix – Your Virtual Wallet for Easy Global Transfers and Payments
Piastrix is a virtual wallet that makes it simple to send money to friends and pay for services anywhere in the world. 
With Piastrix, you get: 
- Easy registration with just your email; 
- Multiple security layers to protect your funds; 
- Top up your wallet via bank cards, online banking, cash terminals, mobile balance, and other payment methods; 
- No fees for transfers or bill payments. 
Note: Some features might not be available in certain countries.

